  "description": "Designing and debugging Visualforce pages: standard/custom controllers, view state management, CSRF and SOQL injection security, PDF rendering, Visualforce email templates. Use when building custom UI pages or PDF outputs on the Salesforce platform. NOT for hardening or rewriting legacy VF in LWC \u2014 use security/visualforce-security-and-modernization. NOT for migrating Classic VF email templates \u2014 use admin/classic-email-template-migration.",
